ise for the most  part keep  stepping out of the bird but if you  really really want to stuff that turkey  get a little one a smaller turkey is  just gonna take less time and obviously  the bigger trick you have the more  stuffing it needs the more timing I am  100% Pro dressing by the time this  stuffing has come to a safe temperature  to eat unfortunately sometimes the bird  gets dry so it's a very tricky dance of  having a juicy moist turkey and stuffing  that safe to eat so one way to avoid  this is just put the stuffing in a pan  and cook it separately so the moral of  the Thanksgiving story is stuffing or  dressing it really doesn't matter just  make something that you love and eat it  with people you love and enjoy that oh  yes
 

